ished":"2026-11-20T21:19:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542897/college-football-games-top-25-schedule-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-20T20:45:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-20T20:32:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami WR Malachi Toney 'really close' to return after ankle surgery, coach says","description":"Miami star wide receiver Malachi Toney is about a week and a half from returning from surgery for a high ankle sprain, coach Mario Cristobal told \"The Pat McAfee Show.\"","published":"2026-11-20T19:00:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542494/malachi-toney-nearing-return-ankle-surgery-coach-says","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Draft buzz: Interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could spur draft trade","description":"If the Titans or Chargers wind up with the No. 1 selection and stick with their franchise quarterbacks, interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could lead to a team seeking to trade up for the top overall pick.","published":"2026-11-20T21:59:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50541939/draft-buzz-mestemaker-spur-auction-no-1-pick","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-20T15:55:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kalen DeBoer says this is his most complete Alabama team","description":"Alabama coach Kalen DeBoer said this is the most complete team he's had since taking over for Nick Saban prior to the 2024 season.","published":"2026-11-20T16:07:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50541432/kalen-deboer-says-most-complete-alabama-team","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Can Nebraska's Matt Rhule end his drought against ranked opponents?","description":"Rhule and Nebraska face back-to-back tests against ranked opponents to end the year, marking an opportunity for the Cornhuskers' coach to end a nearly decade-long streak.","published":"2026-11-20T14:02:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534102/nebraska-cornhuskers-matt-rhule-ranked-win-drought","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4921117/vicari-swain","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vicari_Swain"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Vicari Swain","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vicari_Swain","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:38:07Z","intro":"Vicari S. Swain (born September 12, 2004) is an American college football cornerback and return specialist for the South Carolina Gamecocks.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Swain grew up in Carrollton, Georgia, and started playing football at age six. He attended Central High School where he competed in football and baseball and was a top defensive back and wide receiver in the former. As a junior, he posted 55 receptions for 855 yards and eight touchdowns along with 28 tackles and six interceptions. Swain then recorded 44 receptions for 610 yards and seven touchdowns along with 35 tackles and six interceptions as a senior in 2022. A four-star recruit, he committed to play college football for the South Carolina Gamecocks."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Swain appeared in three games for the Gamecocks as a true freshman in 2023. He then made 13 appearances as a backup cornerback in 2024, recording 13 tackles and a sack. He became a top cornerback and return specialist for the Gamecocks in 2025. In the first two games, Swain had three punt return touchdowns, earning Southeastern Conference (SEC) Special Teams Player of the Week both times. He returned a total of 19 punts for 302 yards and three touchdowns during the season, tying Kaden Wetjen for most punt return touchdowns nationally. He also posted 28 tackles, five pass breakups and two interceptions on defense."}]}}